name: koru.regression.test
kind: measured
shape: categorical
face: in
membrane: false
route: surface, wmfx=regression_shape
note: one card per per-test FLIP (green<->red) between consecutive full runs; value = the new status (success|failure), note carries the test id + failure reason. Raw per-test telemetry — the shape engine derives flap/pass-rate; a regression's WAKE comes from the test-health verdict card, never from the per-test flood.
